    "text": "I have learnt with deep concern about the unfortunate incident involving an attack on a commercial vessel in the Red Sea. According to the information available so far, three Pakistani nationals have lost their lives and one has sustained injuries in the incident. We extend our",
    "translated_text": "我深感关切地了解到红海一艘商船遭到袭击的不幸事件。据目前掌握的消息，事件中已有3名巴基斯坦国民丧生，1人受伤。我们延长我们的",
