  {
    "id": "tweet_CMShehbaz_-4794937078099135421",
    "type": "tweet",
    "username": "CMShehbaz",
    "text": "On International Youth Day, we celebrate the energy, talent and resolve of Pakistan’s youth. Our young people are the driving force of Pakistan’s progress and prosperity, with their innovation and leadership shaping a brighter future for our nation.\n\nMy government remains",
    "translated_text": "在国际青年日，我们庆祝巴基斯坦青年的活力、才华和决心。我们的年轻人是巴基斯坦进步和繁荣的驱动力，他们的创新和领导力为我们的国家塑造了更加光明的未来。\n\n我的政府依然存在",
