  {
    "id": "tweet_JenniferJJacobs_-213626165896344043",
    "type": "tweet",
    "username": "JenniferJJacobs",
    "text": "Asked if he was worried about a missile when he secretly slipped away from AF1 after NATO summit and was whisked to another plane with the help of an airport catering truck, Trump didn't answer directly. He told@nancycordes: \"Uhhhh, I don't worry about anything, to be honest.",
    "translated_text": "当被问及他在北约峰会后偷偷离开AF1并在机场餐饮卡车的帮助下被送往另一架飞机时是否担心导弹时，特朗普没有直接回答。他告诉@nancycordes：“呃，说实话，我不担心任何事情。",
    "images": [
