    "type": "tweet",
    "username": "JenniferJJacobs",
    "text": "\"Iran is going fine, going just absolutely fine,\" Trump told us on tarmac after Ohio trip.\n\"Why, are you saying I trust Iran? I'm the last person to trust Iran. They've lied to me constantly. We have total control over the Hormuz Strait right now. They don't have control. We have",
    "translated_text": "特朗普在俄亥俄州之行结束后在停机坪上对我们说：“伊朗一切顺利，绝对顺利。”\n“为什么，你说我信任伊朗？我是最不信任伊朗的人。他们不断地对我撒谎。我们现在完全控制霍尔木兹海峡。他们没有控制权。我们有",
